        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-black/60">Entry page with the primary brand statement.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-black/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-pink-500/30" href="/case-studies">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-pink-500">Selected Work</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 xs:text-lg sm:text-2xl md:text-2xl lg:text-2xl xl:text-2xl 2xl:text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-black">Case Studies</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-black/60">Split preview page and detailed inner case-study routes.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-black/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-pink-500/30" href="/typography">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-pink-500">Section 02</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 xs:text-lg sm:text-2xl md:text-2xl lg:text-2xl xl:text-2xl 2xl:text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-black">Typography</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-black/60">Structure and interface storytelling page.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-black/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-pink-500/30" href="/what-is">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-pink-500">Section 03</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 xs:text-lg sm:text-2xl md:text-2xl lg:text-2xl xl:text-2xl 2xl:text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-black">What Is</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-black/60">Interaction and narrative definition page.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="rounded-[1.5rem] border border-black/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-pink-500/30" href="/platform">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-pink-500">Section 04</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 xs:text-lg sm:text-2xl md:text-2xl lg:text-2xl xl:text-2xl 2xl:text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-black">Platform</h2>
